er", "fr": "il charge", "id": "dia membebani", "ur": "وہ ذمہ دار ٹھہراتا ہے", "bn": "সে দায়িত্ব চাপায়", "fa": "بار می‌نهد"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0392.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0392.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0392.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0392.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0392.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "يُكَلِّفُ السَّفَرُ مَالًا كَثِيرًا", "spoken": "audio/e5db6472d91ef2288700.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Putovanje košta mnogo novca.", "en": "Travel costs a lot of money.", "bn": "ভ্রমণে অনেক টাকা খরচ হয়।", "fa": "سفر هزینه زیادی دارد.", "fr": "Le voyage coûte beaucoup d'argent.", "id": "Bepergian membutuhkan banyak uang.", "tr": "Seyahat çok paraya mal olur.", "ur": "سفر میں بہت مال خرچ ہوتا ہے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "يُكَلِّفُ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "košta", "en": "costs", "bn": "ব্যয় হয়", "fa": "هزینه دارد", "fr": "coûte", "id": "membebani", "tr": "mal olur", "ur": "خرچ آتا ہے"}}, {"arabic": "السَّفَرُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "putovanje", "en": "travel", "bn": "ভ্রমণ", "fa": "سفر", "fr": "le voyage", "id": "perjalanan", "tr": "seyahat", "ur": "سفر"}}, {"arabic": "مَالًا", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "novca", "en": "money", "bn": "টাকা", "fa": "مال", "fr": "de l'argent", "id": "uang", "tr": "para", "ur": "مال"}}, {"arabic": "كَثِيرًا", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "mnogo", "en": "a lot", "bn": "অনেক", "fa": "بسیار", "fr": "beaucoup", "id": "banyak", "tr": "çok", "ur": "بہت"}}]}, {"arabic": "نُكَلِّفُ أَحْمَدَ بِالْمَهَمَّةِ", "spoken": "audio/4b35a7bbc03f81f1bff1.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "translation": {"bs": "Zadužujemo Ahmeda zadatkom.", "en": "We charge Ahmad with the task.", "bn": "আমরা আহমাদকে কাজটির দায়িত্ব দিই।", "fa": "ما احمد را به این مأموریت می‌گماریم.", "fr": "Nous chargeons Ahmad de la tâche.", "id": "Kami membebani Ahmad dengan tugas itu.", "tr": "Ahmed'e görevi yükleriz.", "ur": "ہم احمد کو